      {'id':'RPF-F011','severity':'medium','title':'Plan frontier does not establish declared grammar exhaustion or candidate membership','evidence':[evidence('code/rust/core_solvers/src/router_plan_grammar.rs',387,447),evidence('code/rust/core_solvers/src/router_structure_extension.rs',92,160)],'status':'router counterexamples reproduced; downstream extension trust source-established','detail':'Wrong grammar digest plus zero evaluations of a nonempty grammar returns NoVerifiedPlan. A Verified-labelled outside candidate with empty replay reference becomes VerifiedFrontier. Bind grammar digest/policy/IDs, enforce exactly-once complete evaluation census and independently check receipts before using the frontier as same-level exhaustion. The extension wrapper currently ignores its supplied evaluation list.','limits':'Routing is explicitly proposal-only and authority None. This finding concerns false finite-exhaustion evidence, not external execution.'},
      {'id':'RPF-F012','severity':'medium','title':'NaN tolerance bypasses numerical cochain validation','evidence':[evidence('code/rust/core_solvers/src/solver_cohomology_sheaf.rs',70,107)],'status':'native direct-source probe reproduced','detail':'d0=d1=[1] passes validate_complex with NaN tolerance and fails with1e-9. Refuse nonfinite/negative tolerances and nonfinite matrix entries before multiplication/SVD; do not use saturating dimensions as evidence of valid quotient inclusion.','limits':'Numerical module, not exact Hodge checker; no claim about external exact owners.'},
